+## branches
+
+`main` keeps the full debug logging for now. the `stable-nodbg` branch has
+the verbose debug output commented out (rx/tx traces, periodic stats dump,
+rx_mode and PHY tune logging) while keeping link state, HW error and
+recovery logging - use that one if you want a quieter dmesg.
